  "ingredients": [
    "1 medium fresh tomatoes",
    "2 medium jalapeno pepper (deseeded)",
    "1/4 medium onion",
    "4 ounce bacon",
    "1 1/2 ounce pork rinds",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "1/4 cup fresh cilantro (chopped)",
    "5 large egg",
    "1 medium avocado"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Finely dice the tomatoes, jalapeño, and onion.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chicharrones-con-huevos/#wprm-recipe-51323-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_2834.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Start by frying the slices of bacon in a pan. Once done, remove and place them on paper towels for later. Try and keep as much of the bacon grease in the pan as possible.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chicharrones-con-huevos/#wprm-recipe-51323-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_2838.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fry the pork rinds in the bacon fat, ensuring that they're coated properly.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chicharrones-con-huevos/#wprm-recipe-51323-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_2851.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the pork rinds are nice and crispy, add the chopped vegetables to the pan. Mix everything and season as needed.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chicharrones-con-huevos/#wprm-recipe-51323-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_2853.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the onions are almost translucent, add the chopped cilantro to the pan. Mix everything.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chicharrones-con-huevos/#wprm-recipe-51323-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_2860.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk the eggs in a separate bowl, add them to the pan, then mix everything. Season as needed.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chicharrones-con-huevos/#wprm-recipe-51323-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_2866.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let this cook like an omelet. When ready, mix once to let the uncooked egg get to the bottom of the pan.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chicharrones-con-huevos/#wprm-recipe-51323-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_2870.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cube an avocado just before serving and fold it into the mixture.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chicharrones-con-huevos/#wprm-recipe-51323-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_2872.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Crumble the bacon and sprinkle over the top, then garnish with optional fresh chopped cilantro and some sour cream, if you'd like.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chicharrones-con-huevos/#wprm-recipe-51323-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
